{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2021-01-07 11:00:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN WATER AND AMERICAN WATER CHARITABLE FOUNDATION DONATE $29,000 TO CAMDEN, NJ ORGANIZATIONS', 'text': "CAMDEN, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN WATER (NYSE: AWK), THE LARGEST PUBLICLY-TRADED U.S. WATER AND WASTEWATER UTILITY COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS DONATED $29,000 TO SEVERAL CAMDEN, NJ BASED NON-PROFIT ORGANIZATIONS. LAST MONTH, THE AMERICAN WATER CHARITABLE FOUNDATION, A 501(C)(3) NON-PROFIT ORGANIZATION CREATED BY AMERICAN WATER, ANNOUNCED A $25,000 DONATION TO CATHEDRAL KITCHEN TO SUPPORT THE ORGANIZATION'S MEAL SERVICE PROGRAM WHOSE REACH RECENTLY EXPANDED IN THE COMMUNITY BECAUS"}